{"id":43134,"date":"2025-07-14T07:54:07","date_gmt":"2025-07-14T06:54:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=43134"},"modified":"2026-11-08T13:59:22","modified_gmt":"2026-11-08T12:59:22","slug":"trail-do-vale","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-do-vale\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail do Vale 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail do Vale 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail do Vale 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>16 de maio de 2027<\/strong>, na aldeia de <strong>Vale Venteiro<\/strong>, Uni\u00e3o das Freguesias de Al\u00e9m da Ribeira e Pedreira, no concelho de <strong>Tomar<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa e Cultural de Al\u00e9m da Ribeira (ARCAR)<\/strong> com o apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Tomar, o evento percorre os vales, linhas de \u00e1gua e trilhos florestais da bacia do rio Nab\u00e3o.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com centro nevr\u00e1lgico de concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, secretariado, partidas e chegada instalado na sede da <strong>ARCAR em Vale Venteiro<\/strong>, o programa competitivo integra o <strong>Trail Longo K34 (34 km com 1100m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Curto K20 (20 km com 600m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini Trail K14 (14 km com 450m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada K10 (10 km com 250m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Os atletas disp\u00f5em de tempos limite de <strong>6h00<\/strong> nos 34 km, <strong>4h00<\/strong> nos 20 km e <strong>3h00<\/strong> nos 14 km. A participa\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica (nas vertentes competitivas), seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos ao longo dos percursos e na meta, assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica, banhos e medalha de finalista. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width