; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada K10 (10 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 16 de Maio de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 \u26f0\ufe0f 250m D+ \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: Sem tempo limite estrito<\/span><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83d\udca7 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Abastecimentos:<\/strong> Abastecimento no percurso e refor\u00e7o na meta<\/div><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83c\udf92 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Material Obrigat\u00f3rio:<\/strong> Dorsal vis\u00edvel, \u00e1gua, copo pr\u00f3prio e cal\u00e7ado confort\u00e1vel.<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail do Vale 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O <strong>Trail do Vale 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>16 de maio de 2027<\/strong>, na aldeia de <strong>Vale Venteiro<\/strong> (Uni\u00e3o das Freguesias de Al\u00e9m da Ribeira e Pedreira), no concelho de Tomar, distrito de Santar\u00e9m.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funciona o secretariado e o local de partida e meta?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado, concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partidas, meta e zona de conv\u00edvio funcionam nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa e Cultural de Al\u00e9m da Ribeira (ARCAR)<\/strong>, em Vale Venteiro.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra quatro dist\u00e2ncias: <strong>Trail Longo K34 (34 km \/ 1100m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Curto K20 (20 km \/ 600m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>, <strong>Mini Trail K14 (14 km \/ 450m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> e <strong>Caminhada K10 (10 km \/ 250m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong>.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os tempos limite (cut-off) das provas competitivas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo m\u00e1ximo para concluir a prova \u00e9 de <strong>6h00<\/strong> para o Trail Longo (34 km), <strong>4h00<\/strong> para o Trail Curto (20 km) e <strong>3h00<\/strong> para o Mini Trail (14 km).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e quando abre o regulamento de 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip eletr\u00f3nico (nas provas competitivas), seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, banhos e medalha de finalista. Os pre\u00e7os por fases e o regulamento oficial da edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027 ser\u00e3o anunciados oportunamente pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail do Vale 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-05-16\", \"endDate\": \"2027-05-16\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Vale Venteiro, Tomar\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Tomar\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"Participa no Trail do Vale 2027 a 16 de maio em Vale Venteiro, Tomar. Provas de Trail Longo 34 km, 20 km, Mini Trail 14 km e Caminhada 10 km. Inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/trail-do-vale-2027.webp\"], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa e Cultural de Al\u00e9m da Ribeira (ARCAR)\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": []}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66892,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[727,820,39],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-43134","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-tomar-santarem","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-santarem"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/trail-do-vale-2027.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/43134","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=43134"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/43134\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":73148,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunnin